{"id":"e1c31444bd8c5ed3","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-lem-silver.md","title":"Silver's Theorem","display":"lem-silver — Silver's Theorem","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-silver","aliases":["58-lem-silver"],"display":"lem-silver — Silver's Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-singular.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-silver"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-silver</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-silver — Silver's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"02120307ea943054\" href=\"?note=02120307ea943054\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-singular.md\">../batch04/58-df-singular.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (共尾数函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sing}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sing}\\)</span> (Sing)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}silver} \\vdash \\forall \\kappa\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\omega\\leq\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\to2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+))\\to2^\\kappa=\\kappa^+\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}silver} \\vdash \\forall \\kappa\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\omega\\leq\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\to2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+))\\to2^\\kappa=\\kappa^+\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Silver's theorem: if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is singular of uncountable cofinality and GCH holds at every infinite cardinal below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>, then GCH holds at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>This revolutionized the study of singular cardinal hypothesis.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-singular.md","status":"resolved","id":"02120307ea943054","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-singular.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{cf}$ (共尾数函数, see [[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sing}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}silver} \\vdash \\forall \\kappa\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\omega\\leq\\lambda<\\kappa\\to2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+))\\to2^\\kappa=\\kappa^+\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1046,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3921","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-lem-silver.md|58-lem-silver]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","02120307ea943054","315ad00b8744fdfc"]}